DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mach mal langsamer!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Wenn ich renne, kommt meine Frisur
ganz durcheinander!

{{TAG:0003:000D:}}W-warte auf mich, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Dieses Gerenne zerknittert mir ja
meine schönen Klamotten!

{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Warum hast du's denn so eilig?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Tut mir leid!
Ich muss weg...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Niye bu kadar acele ediyorsun? Yangın mı var?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Aaa, benim hatam!
Bir yere yetişmem gerek...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}You're walking too fast,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Oh, I'll slow down!
Gotta be somewhere...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡No hay quien te siga,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
¡Iré más despacio!
Me tengo que ir...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Vai troppo in fretta per me,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Oh, ora rallento!
Ho un altro impegno.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Çok hızlı yürüyorsun,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Tamam, yavaşlarım!
Bir yere yetişmem gerek...

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Was?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Bist du dir sicher, dass wir auf
dem richtigen Weg zu {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
sind?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Oh, falsche Richtung!
Ich muss weg...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}What happened,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}We're still going to see {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
today, right?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Did plans change?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
No change! Let's go!
Something came up.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Che succede, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Andiamo ancora da {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}, no?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
O hai cambiato idea?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
No no, andiamo!
Sì, ho un altro impegno.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ne oldu,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bugün hâlâ {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}'ı görmeye gidiyoruz,
değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Planlar mı değişti?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Değişmedi! Hadi gidelim!
Bir iş çıktı.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} are we there yet?
We've been walking so long that my
shoes are out of fashion.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Are you sure we didn't get lost?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
If so,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} I'd like to go back home now.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Sorry!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} geldik mi daha? O kadar uzun
süredir yürüyoruz ki ayakkabılarım
modası geçmiş oldu.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Kaybolmadığımıza emin misin?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Öyleyse,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} artık eve dönmek istiyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Pardon!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¡Tengo que irme, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Acabo de caer en la cuenta de que
he dejado la puerta de casa abierta.{{TAG:0003:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aa, {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}az kalsın unutuyordum! {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Tam şu saniye halletmem gereken acil bir iş var!
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Kusura bakma, {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}ama şimdi eve dönüyorum!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Será mejor que dejes los recados
para otro momento, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Deberíamos darnos prisa.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Jetzt ist nicht die Zeit, um zu
trödeln, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Weiter geht's!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Pekâlâ, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Devam edelim
ama ağırdan alıp bu kadar koşturmayalım!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Yolculuğun tadını çıkar!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Cosa? {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} vuole vedermi?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ormai è passato tanto tempo. Non
credo valga la pena di andare ora.
Sono sicuro che {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
non se ne ricorda nemmeno più.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Se vuole davvero vedermi,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
vedrai che mi chiamerà di nuovo!

{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} vuole {{TAG:0003:0017:}}che mi accompagni
a casa sua?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ma non sei un po' occupat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
in questo momento, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ho sentito che hai visite.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Non vorrai mica essere scortese?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Non preoccuparti di {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Lascia fare a me,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Isn't your friend coming to visit
town soon,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Don't worry about {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I can handle it myself!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}You should go ahead {{TAG:0003:002C:}}and get things
ready for when your friend arrives,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Birazdan arkadaşın kasabaya gelmeyecek mi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} için endişelenme!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Kendim halledebilirim!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Sen git, {{TAG:0003:002C:}}arkadaşın
geldiğinde hazır olmak için hazırlığını
yap,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
